  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action and Support to Avert, Minimize and Address Displacement Related to Climate Change - Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to develop a better understanding of displacement in the context of climate change as part of loss and damage analysis, as well as to improve action and support for measures aimed at preventing, minimizing and addressing displacement related to the adverse effects of change. climate in Guatemala. To this end, an &apos;Action Plan&apos; is established around four pillars (components) of work, which respond to the analysis of specific needs and priorities of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
